I just lost a really sweet game today for some unknown reason.  This is
ver. 3.1.1 on the Atari ST.  I have plenty of memory, so it wasn't
anything like that.

I was at about level 11 or 12 in the Gnomish Mines.  I found a lamp and
decided to #rub it.  I got "You now wield the lamp -more-" when the game
simply froze.  I've never had this happen before.  Usually I get some
error message and I'm dumped out.  But this time nothing.  After I
kept hitting keys, I eventually got the keyboard bell when I typed
a key.  What could this mean?

Furthermore, when I tried the recover.ttp program, I got a REALLY scary
noise from my hard drive.  What was happening?  The head sounded like it
was warping up and down.  I aborted for fear the my drive was being
trashed.

